  "summary": "St. Theodore's, Gates (Rochester). The Mass Times and Confession boxes on page 1 are identical in all four stored bulletins, so the weekend, weekday (Mon-Wed, Fri 8:30) and Saturday 2:30-4:00 Confession slots are settled; the Thursday 8:30 service is a Communion Service and left out. The only question is whether the Eucharistic Chapel, open 6 AM-8 PM daily 'for prayer and reflection' (the website calls it perpetual adoration), counts as daily Adoration.",
